The process $\left( T^i_n \right)_{1 \leq n \leq \sigma_i - \tau_i + 1}$ is equal in distribution to $\left( T_n \right)_{1 \leq n \leq \sigma}$ and is independent of $\mathcal{F}_{\tau_i}$.

