Then, using the spectral theorem for self-adjoint operators, we define, for any measurable function \( g : \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{C} \),
\begin{equation}
\label{mdfmdl}
g(H^\omega)_{(\omega_k \to t\omega_k)} :=
g\!\left(H^\omega\big|_{(\omega_k \to t\omega_k)}\right).
\end{equation}
