ref_dict.thm:graded:
\begin{thm}\label{thm:graded}
Let $S$ be an $\hfam$-admissible set and $m =\bm(S)$. For all $n\geq \hfam(m)$,
\begin{align*}
\hinv(S,n;q) &= \sum_{k=\hfam(m)-m}^{\hfam(m)} b_k(S;q) \qchoos{n-k}{\hfam(m)-k} \\
&= \sum_{\ell =0}^m b_{\hfam(m)-\ell}(S;q) \qchoos{n-\hfam(m)+\ell }{\ell}
\end{align*}
where $\displaystyle b_k(S;q):=  \sum_{\pi \in B_k(S,\hfam(m))} q^{\ell(\pi)}$.
\end{thm}

