Let $n = 2m$ with $m$ even, and let $r < m/2$ be such that $\gcd(r,m) = 1$.  Consider $b,c \in \mathbb{F}_{2^{m}}$
Then
\[
f_{b,c,r}(x,y) = \big(xy,\, x^{2^r+1} + x^{2^{r+m/2}} y^{2^{m/2}} + bxy^{2^r} + cy^{2^r+1}\big)
\]
