Let $\Delta$ be a spherical building.
We write $\CB(\Delta)$ for the simplicial complex on the same
vertex set as $\Delta$ whose maximal simplices are 
$\displaystyle{\bigcup_{\sigma \in \Sigma}} \sigma$ for 
$\Sigma \in \A(\Delta)$. 

\end{definition}

