\label{p:ainblow}
Let \(1 \leq k \leq n\), and let
\(\{   \widetilde \psi_{\underline t}   \}_{\underline{t} \in S^{2k-1}}\)
be the family of Hamiltonian diffeomorphisms of  
$(\widetilde{\mathbb{C}P}\,^n, \widetilde{\omega}_\rho)$
