        \dim \big(U\cap A(F_+,y) \cap E(F_+,\infty)\big) \geq \dim X - \dim Z + 1,
    \end{equation}
    where $Z \subset G$ is the {neutral subgroup of $G$ with respect to $F$} . 
\end{thm}

