This is the set-up in which we will attempt to study sets of the form \eqref{eq:mixedplus}. We will denote by $m_X$ the $G$-invariant Haar probability measure on $X$, and by $m_G$ the Haar measure on $G$ scaled so that the measure of any fundamental domain for $\Gamma$ is equal to $1$. Further,
