subject to initial conditions $(\varrho_{\mathrm{in}},u_{\mathrm{in}},\vE_{\mathrm{in}})$, entirely determined by the limiting behaviour of $h_{\rm in}^{\varepsilon}$ as~$†\varepsilon \to 0$. The viscosity $\nu_0 >0$ and heat conductivity $\nu_1 >0$ as well as the forcing coefficient $\xi(t)$ are explicit.,

