		=
		(\lm)_{a_1} + \cfrac{\lm^{a_1}}{(\lm)_{a_2} + \cfrac{\lm^{a_2}}{\cdots + \cfrac{\cdots}{(\lm)_{a_{t-1}} + \cfrac{\lm^{a_{t-1}}}{(\lm)_{a_t}}}}}\,.
