    $$|S_{\chi}(M,N)| \le (D(r)+o(1))N^{1-\frac{1}{r}} q^{\frac{r+1}{4r^2}}(\log{q})^{\frac{1}{2r}}\left((4r)^{\omega(q)}m_r(q)\right)^{\frac{1}{2r}-\frac{1}{2r^2}}\left(\frac{q}{\phi(q)}\right)^{\frac{1}{r}}.$$
