In \cite[Theorem 1.1 and Remark 1.1]{F3} building on theorems by Milman (\cite{Mi}) and Cheng-Li (\cite{CL}) the author showed the sharp universal inequality $\mu_k(\Omega)\gtrsim k^{\frac{2}{n}}\mu_1(\Omega)$ for any bounded convex domain $\Omega$ in $\mathbb{R}^n$. The above theorem generalizes this inequality in the planar case. 

