ref_dict.Szego Theorem:
\begin{theorem}[Szeg\ho]\label{Szego Theorem}
   Let $\mu\in\Meas$ with $\dd \mu=w\,\dd m+\dd\mu_s$.  Then
    \[
    \exp\Big(\int_0^{2\pi} \log w\,\dd m\Big)=\beta_\mu(1,\infty).
    \]
\end{theorem}

