	Let $(u,v) \in \mathcal{D}^{1,p}(\mathbb{R}^n) \times \mathcal{D}^{1,p} (\mathbb{R}^n)$ be a solution to
\begin{equation}\tag{$\mathcal{S}^*$}\label{P}
