\displaystyle -\Delta_p v\,=\gamma \frac{v^{p-1}}{|x|^p} + v^{p^*-1}+ \nu \beta u^\alpha v^{\beta-1} & \text{in}\quad\R^n \vspace{0.2cm} \\
